<title>USA: White House says &quot;close&quot; to filling Fed vacancies.</title>
<headline>White House says &quot;close&quot; to filling Fed vacancies.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton is &quot;close&quot; to nominating candidates to fill two vacancies on the Federal Reserve Board, the White House said Monday.</p>
<p>The nominees are &quot;close to being announced,&quot; White House spokesman Mike McCurry told reporters. &quot;They've been working to get good, highly qualified nominees and they're nearly finished with it.&quot;</p>
</text>
